1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,660
A young girl walks through a beautiful forest with tall
green trees and sunlight filtering through the leaves.

2
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:12,390
She discovers a hidden temple surrounded by ancient stone
pillars and flowering vines.

3
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:18,039
At the temple she meets a wise old sage sitting peacefully
in the mountain landscape.

4
00:00:18,039 --> 00:00:24,070
The sage teaches her about the harmony between nature and
the peaceful mountain environment.
